    "Signature: layer type accepted by source; decides whether Value or Color applies",
    "Mask: how much of the new value is mixed in, default 1",
    "Toggle RGB, Red, Green, Blue, Alpha: channels affected",
    "Value: replacement number for Mono layers, or a pair of values for UV layers",
    "Color: replacement colour for RGB layers, or colour plus alpha for RGBA layers"
  ],
  "caveats": [
    "Pixels not covered by the mask keep their original values",
    "Set Signature correctly, otherwise the constant does not take effect as expected"
